        "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nNo\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nFor website chats, being able to see what the user is typing in near-real time will allow the staff member to prepare a response or look up that information before the question is fully sent. This improves support responsiveness and leads to a better experience.\r\n\r\nThis is supported by similar software so only right to add the suggestion for consideration later.\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nNone\r\n",
